      text: |
        <p>数据库层　<span style="font-size:9px; color:#B4AA93; font-family:MiSans;">Oracle 19c · 24 张关系表 · 约束与索引</span></p>
  # 右侧注解
  - elementId: note1-leader
    elementType: line
    bounds: [448, 219, 60, 2]
    viewBox: [60, 2]
    points: "0,1 60,1"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: dash, width: 1, color: "$meta"}
  - elementId: note1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [520, 196, 392, 48]
    content:
      fontSize: 10.5
      fontFamily: MiSans
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.55
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-family:思源宋体; color:$crimson;">①</span> <strong>接口隔离</strong>　Controller 只注入 IService，Service 只注入 IRepository，依赖注入统一组装。</p>
  - elementId: note2-leader
    elementType: line
    bounds: [448, 293, 60, 2]
    viewBox: [60, 2]
    points: "0,1 60,1"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: dash, width: 1, color: "$meta"}
  - elementId: note2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [520, 270, 392, 48]
    content:
      fontSize: 10.5
      fontFamily: MiSans
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.55
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-family:思源宋体; color:$crimson;">②</span> <strong>事务边界</strong>　发布、抢单、支付、评价等多表写入，在业务层统一提交或整体回滚。</p>
  - elementId: note3-leader
    elementType: line
    bounds: [448, 367, 60, 2]
    viewBox: [60, 2]
    points: "0,1 60,1"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: dash, width: 1, color: "$meta"}
  - elementId: note3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [520, 344, 392, 48]
    content:
      fontSize: 10.5
      fontFamily: MiSans
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.55
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-family:思源宋体; color:$crimson;">③</span> <strong>SQL 收敛</strong>　Oracle 类型与参数化命令只允许出现在持久层，页面事件与数据库完全隔离。</p>
  - elementId: note4-leader
    elementType: line
    bounds: [448, 441, 60, 2]
    viewBox: [60, 2]
    points: "0,1 60,1"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: dash, width: 1, color: "$meta"}
  - elementId: note4
    elementType: text
    bounds: [520, 418, 392, 48]
    content:
      fontSize: 10.5
      fontFamily: MiSans
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.55
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p><span style="font-family:思源宋体; color:$crimson;">④</span> <strong>静态门禁</strong>　脚本扫描越层引用：Controller 直连 Repository、Service 写 Oracle 命令，均无法通过。</p>
  # 底部调用链
  - elementId: chain
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 486, 864, 14]
    content: {fontSize: 9, fontFamily: MiSans, color: "$meta", letterSpacing: 2, wrap: false, text: VIEW → CONTROLLER → ISERVICE → SERVICE → IREPOSITORY → REPOSITORY → ORACLE}
  - elementId: folio
    elementType: text
    bounds: [430, 514, 100, 14]
    content: {style: "$folio", align: [center, top], wrap: false, text: — 06 —}
